# Project Stack

Plain Java 21 Maven project. No application frameworks.

## Allowed

- Java 21
- Maven (build)
- JUnit 5 (test scope only)
- In-memory data structures

## Not allowed

- Spring (or any DI/web framework)
- Lombok
- Database / JDBC / JPA
- REST API / HTTP server
- Mockito or other test frameworks beyond JUnit 5

## Scope

- Keep everything in memory
- Avoid overengineering
- Implement only what is requested
- Use TDD: write the test first, then minimal production code
